ZABAA'N PE ZAINABE BEKAS THI SADA AMMA...<br>
<br>
Zabaa'n pe Zainabe bekas thi sada amma,<br>
Bas ek din me bhara ghar ujad gaya amma.<br>
<br>
Tumhare laal ka lasha tha bekafan ran me,<br>
Tumhari beti ke sar par na thi rida amma.<br>
<br>
Shadeed dhoop me tashnalabi ke alaam me,<br>
Hussain bhai ka kaata gaya gala amma.<br>
<br>
Hassan ka laal tha Qasim misale mahe tamam,<br>
Ghareeb ghodo'n se pamaal hogaya amma.<br>
<br>
Woh zulm tha ke zamee'n aur asmaa'n kaampe,<br>
Gala jo Asghare masoom ka chida amma.<br>
<br>
Zayeefo bekaso mazloom baap ne badh kar,<br>
Jawaan bete ka lasha utha liya amma.<br>
<br>
'Nawaaz' arzo sama hil gaye dam e aaqir,<br>
Labe Hussain pe jis dam thi ye sada amma...